### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/members/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "uichan@example.com",
  "password": "pw1234",
  "name": "의찬"
}

### --- 웹 흐름 ---
### 세션 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "uichan@example.com", "password": "pw1234" }

### 쿠키로 예약 생성 (HTTP 클라이언트가 쿠키 자동 처리)
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-05-30",
  "name": "브라운",
  "timeId": 1,
  "themeId": 1
}